{
  "#_comment_overview": "Submod-friendly Faction & Fleet-Role Library for Divisions: Command and Control (division_ai). Automatically merged across all enabled mods via Global.getSettings().getMergedJSONForMod('data/config/division_faction_library.json', 'division_ai').",
  "#_comment_organization_ratings": "Supported organizationRating values: 'none' (0% of ships in a division), 'low' (25%), 'average' (50%), 'high' (80% - default fallback for any faction not listed here), 'very_high' (90%), 'perfect' (100%).",
  "#_comment_fleet_roles": "Non-war fleets adapt both their organization rating (via patrolOrganizationRating, merchantOrganizationRating, smugglerOrganizationRating, scavengerOrganizationRating) and their nomenclature (via merchantFleetPrefixes / merchantConvoyNouns / merchantEscortNouns, smugglerFleetPrefixes, scavengerFleetPrefixes). Merchant fleets never call their merchant divisions 'Service Groups'.",
  "#_comment_submod_api": "Submodders can either place a partial data/config/division_faction_library.json in their own mod or call divisionai.FactionLibrary.registerFaction(factionId, attributes) / FactionLibrary.getOrCreateFaction(factionId) in Java.",
